{
  "info": {
    "name": "Company Exam Portal API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the Company Exam Portal backend.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set the `baseUrl` variable to your server (default: `http://localhost:8000`)\n2. Run **Admin Login** first → the `adminToken` variable is set automatically\n3. Run **Company Login** → the `companyToken` variable is set automatically\n4. Student endpoints use `studentToken` (set manually from the student access token)\n\n## Auth Flow\n- Admin & Company use **Bearer JWT** tokens (set automatically via test scripts)\n- Students use their `access_token` as a query param `?token=<access_token>`",
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "companyToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "studentToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Student access_token (UUID). Set manually from student upload or email."
    },
    {
      "key": "driveId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "companyId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ticketId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔒 Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', json.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('Admin token saved:', json.access_token.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/admin/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "admin", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login as admin. Automatically saves the token to `adminToken` collection variable."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Company Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "company_name", "value": "Acme Corp", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "username", "value": "acmecorp", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "email", "value": "hr@acmecorp.com", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "SecurePass123", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "logo", "type": "file", "src": "/path/to/logo.png", "description": "PNG or JPG, max 2 MB" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/company/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "company", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new company with a logo (multipart/form-data). Awaits admin approval before the company can log in."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Company Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('companyToken', json.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('Company token saved:', json.access_token.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"acmecorp\",\n  \"password\": \"SecurePass123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/company/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "company", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login as a company user. Automatically saves the token to `companyToken` collection variable."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
