              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Backend Engineer Aptitude Test\",\n  \"description\": \"Online aptitude test for backend engineering candidates\",\n  \"category\": \"Aptitude MCQ\",\n  \"window_start\": \"2026-03-10T09:00:00Z\",\n  \"window_end\": \"2026-03-10T13:00:00Z\",\n  \"exam_duration_minutes\": 60,\n  \"targets\": [\n    {\n      \"college_id\": null,\n      \"custom_college_name\": \"MIT\",\n      \"student_group_id\": null,\n      \"custom_student_group_name\": \"Computer Science\",\n      \"batch_year\": \"2024\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/company/drives",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "company", "drives"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new drive in **draft** status.\n\n- `window_start` / `window_end`: The overall exam window (ISO 8601 UTC)\n- `exam_duration_minutes`: Each individual student's exam time (must be < window duration)\n- `targets`: At least one targeting entry. Use `college_id`/`student_group_id` for approved entries or `custom_*` for new ones.\n- Categories: Technical MCQ, Aptitude MCQ, HR MCQ, Coding MCQ, etc."
          }
        },
